const e={readingNotes:[{title:{zh:"解释实际选择，先于给出最优建议",en:"Explain observed choices before prescribing an optimum"},body:{zh:"Myers从对企业实际融资行为了解不足出发，比较两类常见解释。他强调一个理论能描述最佳结构，并不表示已经解释管理者为什么选择债务、股权或混合证券。对现实数据的判断，需要先明确理论预测的是目标、选择过程还是公告反应。",en:"Myers starts from limited understanding of actual financing choices and compares two explanations. A theory describing an optimum need not explain why managers issue debt, equity or hybrids. Identify whether a prediction concerns targets, decision processes or announcement responses."},reference:{url:"https://dspace.mit.edu/server/api/core/bitstreams/000e2308-1252-40ad-9a5f-81a8a01a95ae/content",label:{zh:"1984年MIT工作稿 · pp. 1–2",en:"1984 MIT working paper · pp. 1–2"}}},{title:{zh:"权衡理论围绕目标负债率展开",en:"Tradeoff reasoning centers on a target debt ratio"},body:{zh:"静态权衡把借款收益与财务困境成本放在一起，讨论给定资产和投资计划下的目标负债率。不同企业可能有不同目标，因此高杠杆与低杠杆的价值差异不能只归因于融资方式。资产风险和其他决定目标的因素也必须纳入解释。",en:"Static tradeoff reasoning balances borrowing benefits against financial-distress costs, conditional on assets and investment plans. Firms may have different targets. Valuation differences between high- and low-leverage firms therefore cannot be attributed to financing alone without considering risk and other determinants."},reference:{url:"https://dspace.mit.edu/server/api/core/bitstreams/000e2308-1252-40ad-9a5f-81a8a01a95ae/content",label:{zh:"1984年MIT工作稿 · pp. 4–6",en:"1984 MIT working paper · pp. 4–6"}}},{title:{zh:"偏离目标与目标不同是两回事",en:"Different targets differ from deviations from a target"},body:{zh:"存在调整成本时，实际杠杆可能暂时偏离目标；但横截面差异也可能来自各公司的目标本来不同。作者提醒实证研究不要混淆这两种解释。仅观察某家公司负债率上升，既不能断言其远离最优，也不能断言它正在回归目标。",en:"Adjustment costs can keep leverage away from a target, while cross-sectional differences can also reflect different targets. Myers warns against mixing these explanations. An observed increase in leverage alone establishes neither departure from an optimum nor movement back toward it."},reference:{url:"https://dspace.mit.edu/server/api/core/bitstreams/000e2308-1252-40ad-9a5f-81a8a01a95ae/content",label:{zh:"1984年MIT工作稿 · p. 5",en:"1984 MIT working paper · p. 5"}}},{title:{zh:"融资顺序不需要唯一目标比例",en:"A financing hierarchy need not imply one target ratio"},body:{zh:"融资顺序解释优先使用内部资金，必要时再考虑外部融资，并先使用信息敏感度较低的证券。纯粹的顺序模型没有明确的目标债股比，实际杠杆反映累计融资需求。它与权衡理论的差异，不只是哪个模型认为债务比较便宜。",en:"Pecking-order reasoning favors internal funds, then external claims that are less information-sensitive. Its pure form has no well-defined target debt-equity mix; observed leverage reflects cumulative financing needs. The distinction from tradeoff theory goes beyond which model calls debt cheaper."},reference:{url:"https://dspace.mit.edu/server/api/core/bitstreams/000e2308-1252-40ad-9a5f-81a8a01a95ae/content",label:{zh:"1984年MIT工作稿 · pp. 9–10",en:"1984 MIT working paper · pp. 9–10"}}},{title:{zh:"内部权益与外部发股不能合并看待",en:"Internal equity and a new share issue are not interchangeable"},body:{zh:"留存收益和新发行股权在资产负债表上都与权益有关，但融资顺序把它们放在很不同的位置。稳定分红与波动的投资需求会造成资金余缺，使外部需求随时间变化。只看期末权益比例，会隐藏企业实际上采用过哪些融资方式。",en:"Retained earnings and newly issued equity both relate to equity financing, but occupy different positions in the hierarchy. Sticky dividends and varying investment needs create funding gaps over time. An end-of-period equity ratio hides the financing path that produced it."},reference:{url:"https://dspace.mit.edu/server/api/core/bitstreams/000e2308-1252-40ad-9a5f-81a8a01a95ae/content",label:{zh:"1984年MIT工作稿 · pp. 9–10",en:"1984 MIT working paper · pp. 9–10"}}},{title:{zh:"信息成本也可能表现为放弃投资",en:"Information costs can appear as forgone investment"},body:{zh:"当外部投资者无法了解管理层掌握的信息时，融资成本不只是承销费。文中讨论了为保护原股东而放弃正净现值项目的可能性，因此内部资金的价值与投资机会有关。这个机制依赖模型假设，不意味着任何拒绝发股都一定合理。",en:"With asymmetric information, financing costs can exceed underwriting fees: the firm may forgo a positive-value project to protect existing shareholders. Internal funds can therefore matter through investment opportunities. This model mechanism does not make every refusal to issue equity optimal."},reference:{url:"https://dspace.mit.edu/server/api/core/bitstreams/000e2308-1252-40ad-9a5f-81a8a01a95ae/content",label:{zh:"1984年MIT工作稿 · p. 14",en:"1984 MIT working paper · p. 14"}}}],readerLimits:{zh:"本文比较融资行为的解释，不给出企业的最佳负债率。观察到的杠杆同时受融资历史、投资机会和调整成本影响，不能直接当作最优目标。",en:"This compares explanations of financing behavior, not a firm's optimal debt ratio. Observed leverage reflects financing history, investment opportunities and adjustment costs, not necessarily an optimal target."}};export{e as default};
